via bite-sized videos and articles.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:27.540
Everything on the
website is free.

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:30.000
There’s no ads, no
corporate sponsorship,

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:31.020
no kickbacks.

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.540
It’s strictly non-commercial.
I’m not selling anything.

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:36.540
I just put it up as a public service,
as a labor of love,

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:39.000
as a tribute to
my grandmother,

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:43.919
whose own life was saved
with evidence-based nutrition.

